00:07:30.007 --> 00:07:45.920
<v Host>That's all for today. The one hundred and eighth summer high school baseball tournament opens on August fifth, with forty-nine schools playing for the national title until the final on August twenty-second. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

